   "data": "2026-10-28T17:41:51+00:00",
   "testo": "I maintain FiestaBoard , a free, MIT-licensed app for putting information from your services onto a physical display. It runs in Docker on your own host, or on a separate Raspberry Pi using the FiestaPi image. Nothing gets installed inside the display. It supports Vestaboard Flagship, Note and Note arrays, plus Divoom Pixoo 64. You use a browser to connect a display, build pages and schedule what…",
